    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Present design exposes a complete untrusted-to-S3 path through poisoned MCP tool definitions to confidential file read and third-party egress, with no effective severing control and only remembered first-use approval. Forecast remains critical because the highest-risk findings already sit at the top tier; the control whose decay most matters is ctl.first_call_tool_approval, which is not a durable per-call gate and further weakens under model changes or autonomy increases. Manual validation applied because scripts could not be run."
